{
  "kind": "flow-node",
  "version": 2,
  "tool": "graph-reduce",
  "meta": {
    "label": "Graph Reduce",
    "category": "Graph",
    "color": "#0e7490"
  },
  "description": "A pure CALCULATION node — clean / reduce a graph: graph in, graph out. Draws nothing on canvas.",
  "instructions": "A value-only node: it takes a GRAPH as JSON and returns a graph as JSON. It has no geometry input or output and draws nothing on the canvas.\n\nINPUT: graph takes { \"nodes\": [{ \"id\", \"x\", \"y\" }, ...], \"edges\": [{ \"from_node_id\", \"to_node_id\" }, ...] } — coordinates in metres, local to the anchor. Wire Graph Geometry val-graph, or Skeleton val-branches, into valin-graph.\n\nMODES include the Skeleton post-processing that used to live on the Skeleton node: Prune Spurs (drop leaf branches shorter than Min length), Longest Branch (keep only the weighted-diameter path), and Join to Boundary (extend each open leaf tip along its direction out to a boundary polygon — wire Space Geometry's val-points into valin-boundary).\n\nOUTPUT: val-graph publishes the result in the same shape — wire it into a Network node to draw it, or into another graph value node to chain.\n\nEvery parameter is wireable (valin-*).",
  "handles": {
    "input": false,
    "output": false,
    "valueInputs": [
      {
        "key": "graph",
        "label": "Graph"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundary",
        "label": "Boundary"
      },
      {
        "key": "minLength",
        "label": "Min length"
      }
    ],
    "valueOutputs": [
      {
        "key": "graph",
        "label": "Graph (JSON)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "key": "graph",
      "label": "Graph (JSON)",
      "kind": "text",
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mode",
      "label": "Mode",
      "kind": "select",
      "default": "longest-branch",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "longest-branch",
          "label": "Longest Branch"
        },
        {
          "value": "prune",
          "label": "Prune Spurs"
        },
        {
          "value": "dissolve",
          "label": "Dissolve (merge chains)"
        },
        {
          "value": "mst",
          "label": "Min Spanning Tree"
        },
        {
          "value": "largest",
          "label": "Largest Component"
        },
        {
          "value": "loops",
          "label": "Keep Loops"
        },
        {
          "value": "bridges",
          "label": "Keep Bridges"
        },
        {
          "value": "outer",
          "label": "Keep Outer Boundary"
        },
        {
          "value": "inner",
          "label": "Keep Inner Segments"
        },
        {
          "value": "join-boundary",
          "label": "Join to Boundary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "boundary",
      "label": "Boundary (JSON)",
      "kind": "text",
      "default": "",
      "showWhen": "mode == 'join-boundary'"
    },
    {
      "key": "minLength",
      "label": "Min branch length",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 1,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 0.1,
      "unit": "m",
      "showWhen": "mode == 'prune'"
    },
    {
      "key": "iterate",
      "label": "Prune to stable",
      "kind": "checkbox",
      "default": true,
      "showWhen": "mode == 'prune'"
    },
    {
      "key": "mergeTol",
      "label": "Junction merge",
      "kind": "range",
      "default": 0.5,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 5,
      "step": 0.05,
      "unit": "m",
      "showWhen": "mode == 'dissolve'"
    }
  ]
}
